 279:./ucos/Core/os_flag.c **** *                                     DELETE AN EVENT FLAG GROUP
 280:./ucos/Core/os_flag.c **** *
 281:./ucos/Core/os_flag.c **** * Description: This function deletes an event flag group and readies all tasks pending on the event
 282:./ucos/Core/os_flag.c **** *              group.
 283:./ucos/Core/os_flag.c **** *
 284:./ucos/Core/os_flag.c **** * Arguments  : pgrp          is a pointer to the desired event flag group.
 285:./ucos/Core/os_flag.c **** *
 286:./ucos/Core/os_flag.c **** *              opt           determines delete options as follows:
