1069:./ucos/Core/os_flag.c **** *
1070:./ucos/Core/os_flag.c **** *              wait_type     specifies whether you want ALL bits to be set/cleared or ANY of the bi
1071:./ucos/Core/os_flag.c **** *                            to be set/cleared.
