1073:./ucos/Core/os_flag.c **** *
1074:./ucos/Core/os_flag.c **** *                            OS_FLAG_WAIT_CLR_ALL   You will check ALL bits in 'mask' to be clear (
1075:./ucos/Core/os_flag.c **** *                            OS_FLAG_WAIT_CLR_ANY   You will check ANY bit  in 'mask' to be clear (
1076:./ucos/Core/os_flag.c **** *                            OS_FLAG_WAIT_SET_ALL   You will check ALL bits in 'mask' to be set   (
1077:./ucos/Core/os_flag.c **** *                            OS_FLAG_WAIT_SET_ANY   You will check ANY bit  in 'mask' to be set   (
